  "notes": "{発信|はっしん} means transmission or sending, used in telecommunications, messaging, and media.\n\nGRAMMAR:\nUsed as a noun or する verb ({発信|はっしん}する = to transmit/send).\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {発信|はっしん}する: to send, to transmit\n- {発信|はっしん}{元|もと}: source, sender\n- {発信|はっしん}{者|しゃ}: sender, transmitter\n- {情報|じょうほう}{発信|はっしん}: information dissemination\n- SNSで{発信|はっしん}する: to post on social media\n\nCONTRAST:\n- {発信|はっしん}: sending, transmission\n- {受信|じゅしん}: receiving, reception\n\nETYMOLOGY:\n{発|はつ} (emit) + {信|しん} (message/signal)",
